WEBVTT

00:04.000 --> 00:06.610
There is no value in a country 
that has lost all its power.

00:06.940 --> 00:09.740
When a nation's collapse 
is only a matter of time,

00:09.740 --> 00:12.490
the only question is how 
to deal the final blow.

00:13.190 --> 00:15.620
I have a request to make of you, Prince Kyle.

00:17.150 --> 00:21.830
Won't you first form a 
modest alliance with me?

00:23.220 --> 00:25.820
<i>In order to avoid a future in 
which Coyolles is destroyed,</i>

00:25.820 --> 00:28.710
<i>I've formed an alliance with Prince Kyle.</i>

00:29.360 --> 00:30.220
<i>However...</i>

00:31.430 --> 00:35.720
If it were Arnold Hein, then I have the 
feeling that he'd use it quite effectively...

00:37.280 --> 00:39.100
this compound I've created,

00:39.760 --> 00:42.310
which I call black powder.

00:43.600 --> 00:45.600
<i>Professor Michel's aim is to find out</i>

00:45.600 --> 00:49.300
<i>how large an effect black 
powder will have on the world.</i>

00:49.770 --> 00:51.850
<i>To achieve that end, the professor</i>

00:51.850 --> 00:55.400
<i>will surely point out black 
powder's power to Prince Arnold.</i>

00:57.070 --> 01:00.120
<i>I must find a way to stop the professor's 
experiment, no matter what it takes.</i>

03:02.530 --> 03:04.540
<i>These are leto fireflies.</i>

03:04.540 --> 03:06.310
<i>They're so beautiful!</i>

03:34.400 --> 03:36.300
G-Good evening.

03:37.400 --> 03:38.140
Indeed.

03:46.680 --> 03:47.820
What are these?

03:48.260 --> 03:49.470
They're fireflies.

03:50.050 --> 03:50.890
Fireflies.

03:54.080 --> 03:58.210
If you wish for them to be 
exterminated, I'll give the order.

03:58.210 --> 03:59.710
What? Why?

04:00.060 --> 04:02.880
If they're fireflies, then 
they're bugs, aren't they?

04:02.880 --> 04:06.350
Yes, they are bugs, but you mustn't 
thoughtlessly exterminate them.

04:07.220 --> 04:12.430
All animals, humans included, are 
part of one large cycle, you see.

04:15.940 --> 04:17.110
Besides...

04:20.320 --> 04:22.820
You see? They're so beautiful!

04:28.160 --> 04:29.330
Yes, indeed.

04:33.840 --> 04:36.020
<i>What a strange feeling.</i>

04:36.020 --> 04:41.080
<i>All of the things I'm worried about 
stem from His Highness, and yet...</i>

04:47.200 --> 04:50.470
Somehow they all seem to be flying 
toward Your Highness, don't they?

04:50.470 --> 04:52.380
Then you should just come over here.

04:53.940 --> 04:56.020
I suppose you're right.

04:56.320 --> 04:57.830
This much would probably be...

04:59.900 --> 05:01.320
Hey. You wouldn't—

05:34.830 --> 05:37.020
Prince Arnold...

05:37.810 --> 05:39.320
I, um...

05:41.560 --> 05:44.660
If I startled you, I'm sorry.

05:45.250 --> 05:46.840
But I, um...

05:48.850 --> 05:51.070
You do know, don't you?

05:51.070 --> 05:55.350
I can jump a distance like 
that with no problems.

05:57.350 --> 06:02.840
Yes. After all, you can jump down 
to the ground from a palace balcony.

06:03.320 --> 06:04.920
Then, why...

06:08.370 --> 06:13.350
Even though I know, I moved 
reflexively. I couldn't help it.

06:35.680 --> 06:37.570
Thank you.

06:38.580 --> 06:43.380
You do realize that you could have gone out 
into the hallway and come through the door?

06:44.910 --> 06:46.140
Through the door?

06:46.420 --> 06:47.500
Through the door.

06:49.160 --> 06:50.130
You're right!

06:51.610 --> 06:55.560
The way you cut across via the shortest 
route is just like that other time.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.850
Whatever could you mean?

07:01.070 --> 07:03.740
By the way, why do you have your sword?

07:05.520 --> 07:09.350
I mistook the light of the 
fireflies for torches.

07:12.000 --> 07:13.570
<i>Now that he mentions it,</i>

07:13.570 --> 07:16.380
<i>their light does resemble the 
torches you see on a battlefield.</i>

07:20.010 --> 07:24.820
<i>Memories of the war are vividly, 
deeply embedded within him.</i>

07:43.510 --> 07:44.860
They truly are...

07:45.320 --> 07:47.090
such beautiful eyes.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.960
These eyes are the same color as my father's.

07:55.550 --> 07:58.860
They serve as proof that I carry the 
same blood as my father, the emperor.

07:59.580 --> 08:04.440
When I was a child, I very much 
wanted to gouge both of my eyes out.

08:05.170 --> 08:06.190
Your Highness...

08:07.190 --> 08:12.300
They aren't something you 
should gaze at in that manner.

08:14.170 --> 08:19.480
<i>There is a deep hostility between Prince 
Arnold and his father which seems boundless.</i>

08:22.450 --> 08:27.580
The day you first came to this palace, you 
said you had an admiration for this country.

08:28.720 --> 08:33.900
I am unable to feel admiration 
in the same way that you do.

08:34.350 --> 08:36.720
The light of fireflies looks 
like the fires of war...

08:36.720 --> 08:39.240
and looking down from here,

08:39.240 --> 08:41.890
the view of the capital is infuriating to me.

08:41.890 --> 08:45.320
Perhaps it's because of these eyes 
I've inherited from my father,

08:45.320 --> 08:46.930
or perhaps it's because of my nature...

08:47.920 --> 08:51.500
Either way, it doesn't change the 
fact that it's repulsive to me.

08:55.360 --> 09:01.420
Lights seen from far away might look like 
wartime fires or like firefly lights.

09:01.420 --> 09:04.980
The values inherent to such a perception 
aren't inherited from one's parents,

09:04.980 --> 09:08.340
they are gained through all the 
things a person has experienced.

09:10.000 --> 09:12.230
In which case, you just need to learn.

09:12.650 --> 09:16.750
Learn about the beauty of this nation and 
the magnificent things that live in it.

09:17.530 --> 09:20.240
In the future yet to come, you 
can do that as much as you like.

09:21.340 --> 09:23.330
I have no need of such things.

09:23.780 --> 09:27.040
As long as there are things I can use 
to achieve my aims, that's enough.

09:27.040 --> 09:28.010
Your Highness...

09:28.550 --> 09:32.670
I've even killed people I 
held dear with my own hands.

09:33.170 --> 09:36.880
Even you. If you ever become an 
impediment, I'll discard you.

09:37.920 --> 09:42.070
On the matter of Coyolles, I don't 
know what you might be thinking,

09:43.130 --> 09:46.410
but don't make me have to get rid of you.

09:50.080 --> 09:52.200
I can't promise you that.

09:52.200 --> 09:57.440
Should I become your wife, I will 
still move to achieve my own aims.

09:57.440 --> 10:00.220
Even if that means you cast me aside.

10:03.230 --> 10:04.210
However...

10:05.290 --> 10:08.540
when that happens, I'll 
simply return here again.

10:08.540 --> 10:09.380
What?

10:10.040 --> 10:14.210
Even if you cast me aside and 
declare our engagement broken,

10:14.210 --> 10:18.430
I'll interview to become a maid 
and return to this palace.

10:19.530 --> 10:22.000
If that doesn't work, I'll dress 
as a man and become a knight.

10:22.000 --> 10:24.430
And if that doesn't work, 
I'll come as an herbalist.

10:24.960 --> 10:28.270
I'll acquire whatever skills seem like 
they'll let me slip back into the palace,

10:28.270 --> 10:30.440
and I'll come to see you again and again.

10:31.280 --> 10:33.270
So please, don't worry.

10:33.270 --> 10:37.440
I won't stand by and allow you 
to get rid of me, Your Highness.

10:45.410 --> 10:49.830
To me, these eyes are 
your eyes, Prince Arnold.

10:50.510 --> 10:53.480
Even if you, yourself, detest them,

10:53.480 --> 10:55.760
I want to tell you this 
over and over again...

10:57.970 --> 11:02.550
I think your eyes are the most 
beautiful in all the world.

11:10.560 --> 11:13.210
It's late. Go and rest.

11:16.020 --> 11:17.350
Good night.

11:18.100 --> 11:18.830
Yes.

11:27.160 --> 11:32.420
When I was a child, I very much 
wanted to gouge both of my eyes out.

12:11.850 --> 12:13.580
Please look these over.

12:16.080 --> 12:19.050
Coyolles' techniques truly are splendid!

12:19.050 --> 12:20.640
Thank you.

12:20.640 --> 12:24.810
And the finely powdered metals you 
requested are right here.

12:25.490 --> 12:27.940
To be honest, I'm surprised.

12:27.940 --> 12:32.350
Even the trading company I patronize 
has difficulty obtaining all of these.

12:32.670 --> 12:35.300
We've formed an alliance.

12:35.300 --> 12:37.360
Naturally, I should 
do everything in my power.

12:37.760 --> 12:39.340
Thank you.

12:39.900 --> 12:41.570
<i>You feel that way because</i>

12:41.570 --> 12:45.400
<i>you've built honest relationships 
with so many traders, Prince Kyle.</i>

12:46.270 --> 12:50.770
I've managed to obtain an appointment to 
speak with Prince Arnold one more time.

12:51.900 --> 12:55.500
But will this really be 
enough to convince him?

12:56.320 --> 12:57.630
I don't know.

12:57.630 --> 13:01.340
But I'm confident it will be 
enough to entice him to listen.

13:01.850 --> 13:04.120
How can you say that with such certainty?

13:04.120 --> 13:05.840
It is, of course,

13:06.560 --> 13:10.560
because I am Prince Arnold's future wife!

14:01.110 --> 14:03.140
Wh-What is this?

14:03.880 --> 14:04.910
What's going...

14:14.350 --> 14:17.870
Thank you for granting me your time today.

14:17.870 --> 14:19.900
I will say this in advance.

14:19.900 --> 14:22.880
I have no intention of having 
the same conversation again.

14:23.320 --> 14:27.570
I still feel that there is no value 
in an alliance with Coyolles.

14:28.470 --> 14:30.200
I understand your position.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.510
However...

14:31.510 --> 14:35.270
I assume you've brought a 
somewhat worthwhile proposal?

14:35.270 --> 14:37.020
Of course, Your Highness.

14:38.030 --> 14:39.980
<i>I can't allow myself to be daunted.</i>

14:39.980 --> 14:42.510
<i>This is a negotiation. It's a battle.</i>

14:43.400 --> 14:47.160
You sit, too. Let's begin.

14:47.160 --> 14:48.720
Before that, Your Highness...

14:49.590 --> 14:53.660
can you tell exactly how I differ 
from my usual self today?

14:58.030 --> 14:59.790
Earrings. Bracelet.

15:00.300 --> 15:01.670
Necklaces.

15:02.000 --> 15:03.800
None of them are familiar to me.

15:03.800 --> 15:06.420
You've never worn them 
with me before, have you?

15:07.610 --> 15:09.090
It's just as you say.

15:09.440 --> 15:13.540
All of these pieces are 
jewelry made in Coyolles.

15:13.540 --> 15:17.260
In addition to producing metals and gems,

15:17.260 --> 15:20.710
my kingdom is cut off by 
snow for over half the year.

15:21.240 --> 15:23.790
Given the aforementioned conditions,

15:23.790 --> 15:27.120
we have advanced the craft of jewelry 
making, which can be done indoors,

15:27.120 --> 15:29.860
and we have cultivated 
many brilliant artisans.

15:30.440 --> 15:33.140
Even those items, which other countries 
have difficulty producing,

15:33.140 --> 15:37.490
can be completed quickly
and exquisitely by our artisans.

15:37.890 --> 15:41.360
We in Coyolles stand proudly before the 
entire world and say that this is our treasure.

15:53.590 --> 15:55.440
I will make a declaration here...

16:13.570 --> 16:16.120
You recognize this item, don't you?

16:16.120 --> 16:17.740
Well, it does belong to me.

16:18.230 --> 16:19.520
What of it?

16:20.680 --> 16:21.160
This is—

16:21.160 --> 16:22.160
Wait.

16:23.720 --> 16:26.920
It can't be. I never imagined 
that you would notice.

16:28.120 --> 16:32.170
This isn't the piece that 
Your Highness lent to me.

16:32.170 --> 16:34.300
It is a reproduction of that watch.

16:35.680 --> 16:38.440
Prince Arnold, your watch is here.

16:39.760 --> 16:44.650
We borrowed jewelers' equipment
and were able to cast all of the parts.

16:45.120 --> 16:48.560
The one who created this reproduction 
was a jeweler from Coyolles.

16:50.520 --> 16:54.720
Intricate metalworking was used 
to create the gears and screws.

16:54.720 --> 16:58.230
As my kingdom's artisan has accurately 
reproduced the piece,

16:58.230 --> 17:00.470
we are now able to repair it as well.

17:00.470 --> 17:05.080
Prince Arnold, you are already aware of the 
magnificence of this ware called a watch.

17:05.760 --> 17:08.020
These watches are rare in the world,

17:08.020 --> 17:10.620
but have you never wished you could 
possess them in large numbers?

17:11.350 --> 17:17.150
Or perhaps you've imagined turning the 
skills used to produce them to other uses?

17:17.720 --> 17:22.600
Research into technologies which might use 
gears and clockwork has already begun.

17:22.890 --> 17:25.120
Carriages that can move 
even without horses...

17:25.120 --> 17:27.180
Ships that can sail even without wind...

17:27.760 --> 17:31.290
In the not-so-distant future, 
people may dream of such things.

17:31.770 --> 17:33.360
However, when that time comes,

17:33.360 --> 17:37.480
the only country with the skills to make 
those dreams a reality will be Coyolles.

17:38.900 --> 17:40.870
And, Prince Arnold...

17:41.230 --> 17:43.620
I'm certain that you will want them.

17:44.050 --> 17:47.140
You will want to bring their 
technical prowess to Galkhein!

17:51.970 --> 17:53.210
Is that all?

17:55.090 --> 17:57.330
Kyle Morgan Cleverly.

17:57.920 --> 18:00.250
What are you trying to do here?

18:01.400 --> 18:06.300
I acknowledge that the skills your 
country possesses are exceptional.

18:06.860 --> 18:09.660
It is something which my nation lacks.

18:11.610 --> 18:16.110
Which is why, all the more, I 
find your naïvety revolting.

18:17.290 --> 18:21.430
There is no need to form an alliance 
to obtain another country's technology.

18:21.430 --> 18:24.780
Because everything can be taken 
through military force, you see?

18:25.500 --> 18:28.550
Did you come here without a single thought?

18:28.550 --> 18:30.750
Did you simply do as my future wife said...

18:31.370 --> 18:33.440
and come here as ornamental royalty?

18:34.940 --> 18:37.770
Rishe, you're no better.

18:37.770 --> 18:40.390
Say that I obtained this technology.

18:40.820 --> 18:43.750
Did you never imagine 
what I might use it for?

18:45.830 --> 18:48.990
Using metalworking technologies 
as a piece in negotiations...

18:49.920 --> 18:52.510
When this was suggested to me,

18:52.510 --> 18:55.150
I thought you might not be pleased by it.

18:55.530 --> 18:58.780
However, Lady Rishe believed.

18:59.330 --> 19:02.860
"The power to make the future 
a more wonderful place..."

19:02.860 --> 19:05.730
"It isn't possible that Prince 
Arnold won't want that," she said.

19:07.380 --> 19:11.790
I, too, came to this country because 
of my belief in you, Prince Arnold.

19:12.270 --> 19:14.570
You are an outstanding ruler.

19:14.570 --> 19:18.680
And during the war, you showed even 
enemy nations a form of respect.

19:19.260 --> 19:22.990
The reality is that you're kind enough to 
be here, like this, in discussions with me.

19:22.990 --> 19:25.310
That is a naïve way of thinking.

19:26.340 --> 19:32.310
My foolishness lies in thinking to 
rely on you, to have you protect us.

19:32.310 --> 19:36.690
But my decision, the thought that I 
wanted to form an alliance with you,

19:36.690 --> 19:38.690
I don't believe that that was a mistake!

19:41.200 --> 19:43.200
The intellectual power 
of Coyolles' scholars...

19:43.770 --> 19:45.950
and our metalworking technologies...

19:46.260 --> 19:49.910
If we continue to research these 
two things together with your country,

19:49.910 --> 19:54.210
then this future that Lady Rishe 
speaks of won't be simply a dream!

19:55.650 --> 19:58.120
If it will gain your trust,

19:58.820 --> 20:00.980
I will spare nothing.

20:08.590 --> 20:11.980
I'm terribly sorry to interrupt 
your conversation, Prince Arnold.

20:12.440 --> 20:15.200
I hope you are doing well, Prince Kyle.

20:15.200 --> 20:18.940
I offer my deepest apologies for my 
rudeness in disturbing your conversation.

20:18.940 --> 20:22.620
Brother, I am very sorry to interrupt.

20:25.240 --> 20:26.990
<i>An emergency?</i>

20:27.490 --> 20:31.500
I'm terribly sorry. I will excuse 
myself here for a moment.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.980
L-Lady Rishe?

20:32.980 --> 20:34.910
I'm really very sorry.

20:34.910 --> 20:36.060
If you'll excuse me!

20:39.590 --> 20:42.360
Everyone I had shadowing the 
target was given the slip.

20:43.980 --> 20:46.660
We were last certain of his 
whereabouts three hours ago.

20:46.660 --> 20:48.920
He was in a back street in Section 17.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.890
What was the situation when 
they lost sight of him?

20:50.890 --> 20:53.210
Apparently, there was 
some sort of sweet smell.

20:53.210 --> 20:56.240
When they woke, the target's 
whereabouts were unknown.

20:56.850 --> 21:00.610
Which means that the surveillance 
of Michel Hévin has failed.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.340
Well, that seemed hurried.

21:06.340 --> 21:10.970
I offer my apologies as well for my future 
wife and younger brother's rudeness.

21:10.970 --> 21:12.480
Not at all. If we could continue—

21:12.480 --> 21:13.420
Oliver.

21:23.040 --> 21:24.350
Prince Arnold.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.640
What is all this?

21:33.380 --> 21:34.450
Prince Theodore.

21:34.450 --> 21:35.790
I know.

21:35.790 --> 21:39.900
Just as you thought, that man 
was carrying a large bag.

21:40.570 --> 21:43.430
I've already mobilized 
everyone in from the slums.

21:43.430 --> 21:45.410
They're looking into the contents.

21:45.410 --> 21:46.650
Thank you.

21:47.440 --> 21:50.410
But there is one thing that's bothering me.

21:51.210 --> 21:53.160
Prince Arnold.

21:53.160 --> 21:53.960
Yes.

21:54.560 --> 21:57.190
I may be the second prince,

21:57.190 --> 21:59.580
but that isn't enough to allow 
me to barge into a meeting of his.

22:00.120 --> 22:03.080
And he didn't seem at all surprised.

22:05.590 --> 22:06.590
Sister!

22:08.210 --> 22:10.060
We know where that man is.

22:22.890 --> 22:24.070
Professor!

22:28.620 --> 22:30.310
Hey there, Rishe.
